### Create PLC Device
@plantId = 86ca5d65-3c1e-4dbd-9c5a-46ea68a897be
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/devices
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"plantId": "{{plantId}}",
	"name": "Main Digester PLC",
	"type": "PLC",
	"description": "PLC controller for anaerobic digester feed, mixing, heating, and gas handling IO.",
	"protocol": "MODBUS_TCP",
	"host": "192.168.10.25",
	"port": 502,
	"enabled": true
}

### Create Simulated Device
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/devices
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"plantId": "{{plantId}}",
	"name": "Anaerobic Digestion Simulator",
	"type": "SIMULATOR",
	"description": "Simulated device for methane tank temperature, pH, biogas flow, and pressure signals.",
	"protocol": "SIMULATOR",
	"enabled": true
}

### Get All Devices
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/devices

### Get Device Details
@deviceId = 72305f0b-a0dd-43cb-9183-072d768ec2f9
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/devices/{{deviceId}}

### Update Device
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/devices/{{deviceId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"name": "Digester PLC",
	"description": "Updated PLC controller for anaerobic digester feed, heating, gas handling, and safety interlocks.",
	"protocol": "MODBUS_TCP",
	"host": "192.168.10.26",
	"port": 1502,
	"connectionStatus": "DISCONNECTED",
	"enabled": true
}

### Delete Device
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/devices/{{deviceId}}

### Connect Device
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/devices/{{deviceId}}/connect

### Disconnect Device
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/devices/{{deviceId}}/disconnect